            "The clock for cycle time usually starts at the commitment point. Everything before it is planning; everything after it is delivery, governed by [WIP limits](/project-management/kanban/wip-limits/). Our free [product backlog template](/templates/product-backlog-template/) helps you keep options tidy, and a [work request template](/templates/work-request-template/) gives stakeholders a consistent way to submit new ones.",
